SELECT 
	DISTINCT 
	IDENTITY(INT,1,1) AS Id, 
	WinLostDate, 
	STUFF(c.custid,1,1,'') as custids 
INTO #data
FROM #WLDate a
CROSS APPLY
	(
		SELECT ','+ CONVERT(varchar(10),custid) 
		FROM #WLDate b
		WHERE b.WinLostDate = a.WinLostDate
		FOR XML PATH ('')
	) AS c(custid)

--
DECLARE @wldate SMALLDATETIME
DECLARE @custids VARCHAR(MAX)
DECLARE @Id INT = 1 

WHILE @Id <= (SELECT MAX(Id) FROM #data)
BEGIN
	SELECT @wldate = WinLostDate , @custids = custids
	FROM #data
	WHERE Id = @Id
	
	--
	--SELECT @wldate,@custids
	PRINT @wldate
	EXECUTE Task_Sum_Winloss_Old @WinlostDate = @wldate, @CustIds = @custids, @ProductIds = '73'
	WAITFOR DELAY '00:00:02'
	--

	SET @Id = @Id + 1
END
--

DROP TABLE #WLDate
DROP TABLE #data